{"products":[{"id":8039096516659,"title":"【 展示品出清 】Tom Dixon Puff 吊燈 (黃銅)","handle":"tom-dixon-puff-pendant","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e商品位置：\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e潤舍倉庫 (TOD00413)\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e商品情況：展示痕跡\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eTom Dixon Puff 吊燈以充氣結構的幾何形態為靈感，由 30 片菱形金屬板拼組成直徑 45 公分的多面體。平整的板材在折角處相接，構成如鼓起般的立體輪廓，在硬挺的金屬結構中保留飽滿的體積感。\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e黃銅色不鏽鋼燈罩表面布有細密穿孔，點亮時光線由孔隙間透出；未開燈時，多面體的各個折面反射環境光線，呈現層次分明的金屬光澤。單盞懸掛於餐桌上方，或用於客廳、玄關，都能成為空間的視覺焦點。\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-11-19T17:59:57+08:00","created_at":"2026-10-29T20:52:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:24:11+08:00","vendor":"Tom Dixon","product_type":"吊燈","tags":["Tom Dixon"],"variants":[{"id":45231661416499,"title":"黃銅*","option1":"黃銅*","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"TOD00413","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":32516341235763,"product_id":8039096516659,"position":1,"created_at":"2025-01-10T11:46:22+08:00","updated_at":"2025-12-26T01:31:06+08:00","alt":"進口吊燈 Tom Dixon Puff 吊燈｜餐廳吊燈推薦｜原廠授權代理商","width":2000,"height":2000,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0744\/0467\/files\/Tom-Dixon-Puff-_-Tom-Dixon_-_-_-Luxury-Life-4176464.jpg?v=1766683866","variant_ids":[45231661416499]},"available":false,"price":"60200.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8039096516659,"created_at":"2026-10-29T20:52:07+08:00","updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:24:11+08:00"}],"images":[{"id":32516341235763,"created_at":"2025-01-10T11:46:22+08:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-12-26T01:31:06+08:00","product_id":8039096516659,"variant_ids":[45231661416499],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0744\/0467\/files\/Tom-Dixon-Puff-_-Tom-Dixon_-_-_-